// node tests/v507-test.js — v5.07 (Sally agreed 11/14, owner BUILD; section policy so-far-v1): Reports › So far. Two new groupings in By (Market from the
// versioned alias table market-alias-v1, and Sport · type · market); every grouping's table gains Games, ROI 95% range (whole games re-drawn, paired
// ratio of sums), Expected vs actual (La Contadora's own frozen pregame forecast only), CLV with coverage and a Read word that replaces Sample; a
// many-group check (Benjamini–Hochberg at 10%) across the rows with 100 outcomes on 50 games; the So far card follows the grouping, period and filters.
// Display only: the Scorecard and Said vs won numbers are pinned to their v5.05 values (Los Desconfiados C3) and must not move.
// Every expected number was computed by the plan (scratchpad v507-plan.md, Appendix A run inside the real page) and checked again by Los Desconfiados.
// "(plan seed)" values depend on the seed rule (FNV-1a of the row's own per-game numbers) and are exact only for it.
// v5.07 fixer (the reviewers' findings): a prop saved with no sport takes the sport its event proves (one sport only); no range under 15 settled games;
// a Leaning line shows its 90% range; "Settled games"; the card says "(incl. open)", where the grouping is changed and how many groups the many-group check
// covered (and that a filter narrows it); a sign stays with its dollar amount; 641–999 px are cards; parlays read "Parlay" and say why they have no close.
